# Optional release pins for the all-in-one image, verified by the fetch stage.
# One line per tool in sha256sum format (64 hex chars, two spaces, zip
# basename), for example:
#
#   0123456789abcdef...  <name-of-tool-zip>
#
# Only lines starting with a full 64-hex digest are honoured; tools without a
# matching line are fetched unpinned. Eric's releases move without version
# markers in the URL, so refresh pins deliberately when updating.
